# Cave rats (11-05, CIPlay ironreef_caverns_rats; in a test world): one rat at the hall end of the Reef Workings'
# tunnel B and one at the hall's east end - alive, on the dug floor, under the rock (not on the hill over the tunnel), walking; pictures of both
# pairs. Points as in its recipe.
# (11-07: the player waits outside mouth A, 20 m and more from both rats: in the hall, 9-11 m from them, a rat ran out
# and killed him; the checks don't need him near. fix1107i: rats moved under the hall's roof, 10.5 m and more from
# the open mouths - see the recipe; the wait is 30 s: in 15 s neither rat once got 1 m from its start)
island Ironreef Caverns keep
offset 1.3339 0.1645
hour 11
weather Calm
at -44.6 -22.4
wait 5
# (FZ7, fix-open 11-19: the B rat waits in the hall end until a player is in tunnel B - zone ir_tunnelb, 2.5 m past
# the open stretch; it roamed out of the open mouth in 1 of 2 runs. So: only the C rat at first, then walk into tunnel B)
expect animals Rat 1
expect animalsinside Rat 1
picture rat_ironreef_c_out -14 17.2 -45.4 -19 16.2 -43.6
picture rat_ironreef_c_in -26 21 -30 -21.5 19.6 -30.2
wait 30
expect animalsmoved Rat 1
expect animals Rat 1
expect animalsinside Rat 1
picture rat_ironreef_b_out -37.6 +1.7 -46.4 -34.6 17 -42.6
at -37 -44.5
walk -37 -44.5 to -35 -43 to -31.6 -40.9 to -30.4 -40.2 below=22
wait 3
expect animals Rat 2
expect animalsinside Rat 2
picture rat_ironreef_b_in -30.4 20.2 -40.2 -25.8 19.3 -33.4 aim=Rat light=20
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0
walk -30.4 -40.2 to -31.6 -40.9 to -35 -43 to -37 -44.5 below=22
